  "bio": {
    "zh": [
      "自學出身的全端工程師。我習慣一個人把一個想法從零做到能跑、能用、能交給別人。",
      "做過 Go 寫的跨平台 CLI 工具、串接 LINE 與 Telegram 的 AI Bot、以及 Chrome Extension —— 從 API 整合、容器化到雲端部署都自己來。",
      "現在專注在 **LLM** 與 **AI Agent** 的實際落地：怎麼把它嵌進真實的工作流程，而不只是接一個 API。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "A self-taught full-stack engineer. I like taking an idea from zero to something that runs, works, and can be handed to someone else.",
      "I've built a cross-platform CLI tool in Go, AI bots on LINE and Telegram, and a Chrome extension — owning API integration, containerization and cloud deployment end to end.",
      "I focus on making **LLMs** and **AI Agents** actually land in real workflows, rather than just wiring up an API."
    ]
  },
